<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-Hant">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title>占卜 API Demo</title>
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <style>
    body { font-family: sans-serif; padding: 20px; }
    textarea, select { width: 100%; padding: 10px; margin-top: 10px; }
    button { padding: 10px 20px; margin-top: 10px; }
    #result { white-space: pre-line; margin-top: 20px; padding: 15px; background: #f0f0f0; border-radius: 6px; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <h2>有 API 的占卜網站</h2>
  <p>這是示範：前端呼叫後端 API，而不是前端亂數。</p>

  <label>星座</label>
  <select id="sign">
    <option>牡羊座</option>
    <option>金牛座</option>
    <option>雙子座</option>
    <option>巨蟹座</option>
    <option>獅子座</option>
    <option>處女座</option>
    <option>天秤座</option>
    <option>天蠍座</option>
    <option>射手座</option>
    <option>摩羯座</option>
    <option>水瓶座</option>
    <option>雙魚座</option>
  </select>

  <label>想補充給宇宙的小事</label>
  <textarea id="note" placeholder="例如：最近在為了喜歡的人煩惱。"></textarea>

  <button id="askBtn">詢問宇宙 API</button>

  <div id="result"></div>

  <script>
    document.getElementById("askBtn").addEventListener("click", async () => {
      const sign = document.getElementById("sign").value;
      const note = document.getElementById("note").value;

      document.getElementById("result").textContent = "宇宙正在思考...";

      const resp = await fetch("/api/fortune", {
        method: "POST",
        headers: { "Content-Type": "application/json" },
        body: JSON.stringify({ sign, note })
      });

      const data = await resp.json();
      document.getElementById("result").textContent = data.text;
    });
  </script>
</body>
</html>

